<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAB ANNOUNCES $360 MLN SHARE OFFER.</title>
<headline>SAB ANNOUNCES $360 MLN SHARE OFFER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Breweries Ltd announced on Friday that it had authorised an offering of around $360 million to fund its international expansion.</p>
</text>
